<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb fuel oil output down 11.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb fuel oil output down 11.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 3.8295 million tonnes of fuel oil in the first two months of this year, down 11.5 percent from the same period in 1996, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 1.8661 million tonnes of fuel oil in February alone, the bureau said. It gave no figure for the month in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
